        "note": "Only 0 clear rows north of the circuit entrance (the other belt entrances sit on the rows just above it, all four side-loading onto the ring's west column), so a green-circuits copy cannot sit directly west with its exit on this row without covering the copper, plastic, steel and acid approaches: place it further south or west and bring its belt in on row 6."
