    "setupNotes": [
      "Factorio 2.1.24 Space Age, normal quality: assembling machine 2 only, no modules, red belts, fast inserters. Makes processing units and low density structures at 5 per minute each and passes rocket fuel through, so the three rocket ingredients (50 of each per rocket) wait side by side in three passive provider chests on the EAST edge: rocket fuel, processing units, low density structures from the north, 400 each (chest bars). WEST entrances: rocket fuel (northernmost, from one rocket-fuel supplier), copper plate, plastic bar, steel plate, electronic circuits (southernmost, from a green-circuit supplier) on belts and sulfuric acid by pipe; each panel gives the supply to plan for. Supply electricity at either substation. Preserve the red wires on the ring tiles, entrance belts and arms (per-tile hold readers and stock limits), the arm filters and the chest bars.",
      "Supply per minute (the entrance panels): rocket-fuel 5, copper-plate 120, plastic-bar 45, steel-plate 10, electronic-circuit 120, sulfuric-acid 25. One rocket-fuel supplier (6 per minute) covers the rocket fuel; one green-circuit supplier (360 per minute) covers these 120 circuits and the launch kit's together, split its exit belt between them.",
      "Feed the silo from the three east chests: 50 rocket fuel, 50 processing units and 50 low density structures make one rocket. The chests stop at 400 each (8 rockets: the six-rocket campaign plus two spare) and the factory stops by itself; it restarts as soon as items are taken.",
      "Do not remove the chest bars or the red wires: the bars are the caps, and the ring stock limits keep the ring from clogging."
    ]
